    {
      "source": "<code>methodParameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve. This parameter must have previously been passed to\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must have returned true.",
