    {
      "source": "Extracts paging information from web requests and thus allows injecting <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> instances into controller\nmethods. Request properties to be parsed can be configured defaulting to <code>page</code> for the page number and\n<code>size</code> for the page size.",
      "translation": "从 Web 请求中提取分页信息，从而允许将 <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 实例注入到控制器方法中。可解析的请求属性可以配置，默认情况下，页码对应于 <code>page</code>，每页大小对应于 <code>size</code>。",
      "count": 1
    }
